lass=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ Immerse yourself in a touching story set in a mysterious fantasy world, full of magic, surprises, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ Embark on thrilling fantasy adventures and face monsters as you uncover hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ Enjoy 100 beautiful CGs that enhance the story and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ Your choices matter! Experience the exciting story with branching paths and multiple endings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
